#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:234
#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:339
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Développez la section Advanced Options"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:234
msgid ""
"The user configured on the cloud will need access to the objects in the "
"S3 bucket configured on the CUR.  If creating the CUR via the |morpheus| "
"UI, this should be done automatically.  If an existing CUR report or "
"existing S3 bucket was selected, ensure the user has permissions to "
"access the objects in the configured S3 bucket.  Alternatively, the "
"**COSTING KEY** and **COSTING SECRET** can be used to configure a "
"different user that has access to the S3 bucket."
msgstr "L'utilisateur configuré sur le Cloud aura besoin d'accéder aux objets du bucket S3 configuré sur le CUR. Si le CUR est créé via l'interface |morpheus|, cela devrait être fait automatiquement. Si un rapport CUR existant ou un bucket S3 existant a été sélectionné, assurez-vous que l'utilisateur a les autorisations pour accéder aux objets du bucket S3 configuré. Sinon, les champs **COSTING KEY** et **COSTING SECRET** peuvent être utilisés pour configurer un autre utilisateur ayant accès au bucket S3."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:240
msgid ""
"Begin by logging into the `AWS Billing Console "
"<https://console.aws.amazon.com/billing/home?#/>`_, then click "
":guilabel:`Create report`."
msgstr "Commencez par vous connecter à la `AWS Billing Console <https://console.aws.amazon.com/billing/home?#/>`_, puis cliquez sur :guilabel:`Create report`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:242
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/1billingConsole.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:244
msgid ""
"Include a name for your report and mark the box to \"Include resource "
"IDs\". |morpheus| uses these resource IDs to map costs to various "
"resources. Click :guilabel:`Next`."
msgstr "Indiquez un nom pour votre rapport et cochez la case « Include resource IDs ». |morpheus| utilise ces ID de ressource pour associer les coûts à diverses ressources. Cliquez sur :guilabel:`Next`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:246
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/2reportConfig.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:248
msgid ""
"On the following page, begin by identifying an S3 bucket to house "
"reports. Click :guilabel:`Configure` near the top of the page and select "
"an existing bucket or create a new one."
msgstr "Sur la page suivante, commencez par identifier un bucket S3 pour héberger les rapports. Cliquez sur :guilabel:`Configure` en haut de la page et sélectionnez un bucket existant ou créez-en un nouveau."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:250
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/4chooseBucket.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:252
msgid ""
"After identifying the bucket, you must mark the box to accept the default"
" policy being applied to the bucket. Click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "Après avoir identifié le bucket, vous devez cocher la case pour accepter la stratégie par défaut appliquée au bucket. Cliquez sur :guilabel:`Save`."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:254
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/5confirmPolicy.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:256
msgid "The default policy applied to the bucket is below:"
msgstr "La stratégie par défaut appliquée au bucket est la suivante :"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:258
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"Version\": \"2008-10-17\",\n"
"  \"Id\": \"SomeID\",\n"
"  \"Statement\": [\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"Sid\": \"SomeStmtID\",\n"
"      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"      \"Principal\": {\n"
"        \"Service\": \"billingreports.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"Action\": [\n"
"        \"s3:GetBucketAcl\",\n"
"        \"s3:GetBucketPolicy\"\n"
"      ],\n"
"      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::bucket-name\"\n"
"    },\n"
"    {\n"
"      \"Sid\": \"SomeStmtID\",\n"
"      \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n"
"      \"Principal\": {\n"
"        \"Service\": \"billingreports.amazonaws.com\"\n"
"      },\n"
"      \"Action\": [\n"
"        \"s3:PutObject\"\n"
"      ],\n"
"      \"Resource\": \"arn:aws:s3:::bucket-name/*\"\n"
"    }\n"
"  ]\n"
"}"
